OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells will develop as cloud breaks
OL,7,Fovernight but still a few showers will
OL,8,Fcontinue moving across the province in
OL,9,Fthe fresh westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA few showers to start the
OL,12,Fday in the north, a lot of dry and
OL,13,Fbright weather around with Autumn
OL,14,Fsunshine, winds easing and a pleasant
OL,15,Fend to the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
